  "summary": "OpenBao before 2.6.5 and 2.7.2 Path Traversal in Transit Key Import",
  "details": "OpenBao before 2.6.5 and 2.7.2 contains a path traversal vulnerability in Transit key import that allows authenticated attackers to bypass name restrictions in ACL policies. Attackers limited by a required_parameters name constraint can craft traversal sequences during import to write key material under arbitrary Transit key names.",
